WEBVTT

00:00:00.468 --> 00:00:04.015
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> Hello, Pam. How are you this morning?

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:05.664
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> Hello, Sue.

00:00:05.842 --> 00:00:11.386
I’m fine thanks, but you’ll never guess what’s happened.

00:00:12.048 --> 00:00:14.911
Jack and Emma have broken up!

00:00:14.935 --> 00:00:18.521
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> No! That can’t be true.

00:00:18.545 --> 00:00:25.586
Jack and Emma? Your neighbours? I saw them last week and they looked really happy.

00:00:25.923 --> 00:00:29.076
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> No, it’s definitely true.

00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:31.988
I heard them shouting.

00:00:32.557 --> 00:00:35.486
Hum, they were having a terrible argument.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.430
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> No! When?

00:00:38.454 --> 00:00:39.989
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> Last night.

00:00:40.251 --> 00:00:43.053
 After he came home from work.

00:00:43.223 --> 00:00:44.723
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> What did they say?

00:00:44.945 --> 00:00:47.937
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> Well, I wasn’t really listening…

00:00:48.516 --> 00:00:50.301
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> Er, of course not.

00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:54.021
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> But I couldn’t help hearing.

00:00:54.163 --> 00:01:00.623
She was talking so loudly and of course the walls are very thin…

00:01:00.925 --> 00:01:02.480
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> So, what did they say?

00:01:02.504 --> 00:01:08.797
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> Well, she said that she was going to stay with her mum!

00:01:09.526 --> 00:01:12.797
She told him that she wouldn’t come back.

00:01:12.821 --> 00:01:18.664
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> Ooh, how awful. What about the children?

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:23.595
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> She said she’d taken them to her sister’s.

00:01:24.035 --> 00:01:27.689
I suppose she’ll take them with her in the end.

00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:35.738
And anyway, then five minutes later, I saw her leaving the house with a suitcase!

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:42.581
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> No! Why do you think she’s leaving him? Is he seeing somebody else?

00:01:42.605 --> 00:01:44.835
<v><b>Pam:</b></v> Um, I don’t know…

00:01:44.962 --> 00:01:48.308
<v><b>Sue:</b></v> I must go and tell Janet at number 14.

00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:51.419
She’s always thought there was something…um,

00:01:51.725 --> 00:01:54.355
something strange about him.